                                    <div class="newsDate">October 21, 2026</div>
                                    <p>Atlantic Cape is proud to announce our President&#8217;s and Dean&#8217;s List honorees from the Summer 2026 Semester. All 37 President&#8217;s List honorees earned at least 12 credits during the Summer Semester with a 4.0 GPA. All 238 Dean&#8217;s List honorees also earned at least 12 credits during the Summer Semester with a 3.0 GPA or higher.</p>
