                                    <div class="newsDate">December 4, 2025</div>
                                    <p>Atlantic Cape and the Foundation raised a record $33,269 during GivingTuesday on December 2, shattering its goal of $25,000, while raising nearly $18,000 for our campus food pantries thanks to the tremendous outpouring of selfless giving and philanthropy from more than 150 donors, supporters and alumni.</p>
