                                    <div class="newsDate">November 21, 2025</div>
                                    <p>Atlantic Cape has been awarded $52,500 from the NJ Office of the Secretary of Higher Education (OSHE) to support campus-based resources, including food pantries and outreach connecting students with SNAP, as part of a $1.2 million Hunger-Free Campus Act grant to 36 institutions of higher education across the State.</p>
