                                    <p>Begun nearly seven years ago as an annual gesture to personally thank its many generous donors, sponsors and supporters, Atlantic Cape and President Dr. Barbara Gaba welcomed 65 guests to Car&#234;me&#8217;s for the President&#8217;s Holiday Reception on November 19.</p>
