                                    <p>With a powerful trifecta of freshmen student-athletes leading the way, the rejuvenated Atlantic Cape Buccaneers women&#8217;s basketball team took the National Junior College Athletic Association&#8217;s (NJCAA) Region 19 by surprise last season as they earned a berth in the playoffs.</p>
