            					<div class="content">
            						<h2>Atlantic Cape Alumni and Former County Officials Reflect as Cape May County Campus Celebrates 20 Years</h2>
                                    <div class="newsDate">October 14, 2025</div>
                                    <p>From its humble beginnings in 1973 in a small office space on Route 9 in Rio Grande and long before the word &#8220;Cape&#8221; was added to its official name in 1999, Atlantic Cape has been proudly providing the residents of Cape May County with the opportunity to access an elite higher education.</p>
