                                    <div class="newsDate">October 8, 2025</div>
                                    <p>Atlantic Cape Foundation&#8217;s Annual Scramble &#8216;FORE&#8217; Scholarships Golf Tournament to support student scholarships raised a record $76,000, while Robert Mullock, owner of the host venue Cape May National Golf Club, announced the creation of a $100,000 endowment in his family&#8217;s name.</p>
