            						<h2>Atlantic Cape Receives $75,000 Grant from Metallica Scholars Initiative to Support Aviation Program</h2>
                                    <div class="newsDate">October 7, 2025</div>
                                    <p>Atlantic Cape is proud to announce its selection as one of 15 nationwide recipients to join Year 7 of the prestigious Metallica Scholars Initiative (MSI). Supported by a generous $75,000 grant aimed at enhancing the College&#8217;s Air Traffic Control and Professional Pilot students while on the path towards a rewarding career in the Aviation industry.</p>
