            				<div class="cell">
            					<div class="content">
            						<h2>Award Recipients for Women of Wonder 2025 Announced; Tickets, Sponsorship &amp; Advertising Opportunities Still Available</h2>
                                    <div class="newsDate">September 22, 2025</div>
                                    <p>The Atlantic Cape Community College Foundation and the Cape May County Women's Commission are excited to announce the three 2025 Women of Wonder award recipients, who will be recognized at this year&#8217;s annual fundraising event on Thursday, November 13, 11:30 a.m. at The Flanders Hotel in Ocean City.</p>
