            						<h2>42nd Annual Atlantic Cape Restaurant Gala to Feature Cheers and Frasier Star Kelsey Grammer and His Faith American Brewing Co.</h2>
                                    <div class="newsDate">March 13, 2025</div>
                                    <p>This year&#8217;s 42nd Annual Atlantic Cape Community College Restaurant Gala is going Broadway and will feature Hollywood appeal with Cheers and Frasier star Kelsey Grammer representing his Faith American Brewing Company.</p>
