            						<h2>Atlantic Cape to Offer Free Online Clemente Humanities Course on War and Reconciliation for U.S. Veterans </h2>
                                    <div class="newsDate">March 12, 2025</div>
                                    <p>Atlantic Cape is proud to offer for our dedicated military veterans a FREE 12-week online Clemente Course in the Humanities that will examine the themes of war and reconciliation through the study of literature, philosophy, art, history and writing.</p>
                                    <a aria-label="Read Article About Atlantic Cape to Offer Free Online Clemente Humanities Course on War and Reconciliation for U.S. Veterans " class="ctaLink" href="2025/03/clemente-course.php">Read Article</a>
